#{[17592186045463 #edb/ref 10 :activity.type/lesson #edb/ref 17592186045416] [17592186045485 #edb/ref 10 :question.difficulty/easy #edb/ref 17592186045416] [17592186045487 #edb/ref 10 :question.difficulty/moderate #edb/ref 17592186045416] [17592186045493 #edb/ref 10 :answer-field.type/radio #edb/ref 17592186045416] [17592186045497 #edb/ref 10 :answer.type/image #edb/ref 17592186045416] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1003 #edb/ref 17592186046656 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045694 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045695 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045696 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045697 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045698 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045699 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045700 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045701 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045702 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045703 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045704 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045705 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045706 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045707 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045708 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045709 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045710 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045711 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #edb/ref 17592186045712 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046647 #edb/ref 1004 #